title: State Diagram
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
tags: MermaidExample

A state diagram models the lifecycle of an entity by showing states and the transitions between them. Use it for order workflows, document approval pipelines, connection protocols, and UI screen flows. Uses `stateDiagram-v2`.

---

!! Basic example

```
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Processing : start
    Processing --> Done : complete
    Processing --> Error : fail
    Done --> [*]
    Error --> Idle : retry
```

$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Processing : start
    Processing --> Done : complete
    Processing --> Error : fail
    Done --> [*]
    Error --> Idle : retry
$$$

---

!! Real-world example: Order fulfilment lifecycle

This example tracks an order through the fulfilment pipeline from placement to delivery or cancellation. State types are color-coded: initial/terminal states, active processing states, review gates, and failure states.

```
stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Order fulfilment lifecycle
    accDescr: States and transitions from order placed to delivered or cancelled

    %% ── Entry ───────────────────────────────────
    [*] --> Placed:::initial

    %% ── Processing pipeline ──────────────────────
    Placed --> PaymentPending : confirm order
    PaymentPending --> PaidConfirmed : payment succeeds
    PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed : payment declined
    PaymentFailed --> PaymentPending : retry payment
    PaymentFailed --> Cancelled:::terminal : abandon

    %% ── Fulfilment stages ────────────────────────
    PaidConfirmed --> Picking : send to warehouse
    Picking --> Packing : items picked
    Packing --> ReadyToShip : packed

    %% ── Shipping review ──────────────────────────
    ReadyToShip --> AwaitingCarrier : carrier notified
    AwaitingCarrier --> InTransit : carrier collected

    %% ── Delivery and returns ─────────────────────
    InTransit --> Delivered : delivered successfully
    InTransit --> DeliveryFailed : delivery attempt failed
    DeliveryFailed --> InTransit : re-attempt delivery
    DeliveryFailed --> ReturnedToSender : max attempts exceeded
    Delivered --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    ReturnedToSender --> Cancelled:::terminal

    %% ── Class definitions ───────────────────────
    classDef initial    fill:#6c757d,stroke:#495057,color:#fff
    classDef active     fill:#0d6efd,stroke:#084298,color:#fff
    classDef gate       fill:#fd7e14,stroke:#984c0c,color:#fff
    classDef failure    fill:#dc3545,stroke:#842029,color:#fff
    classDef terminal   fill:#198754,stroke:#0f5132,color:#fff

    class Placed initial
    class PaymentPending active
    class PaidConfirmed active
    class Picking active
    class Packing active
    class ReadyToShip active
    class AwaitingCarrier gate
    class InTransit gate
    class DeliveryFailed failure
    class PaymentFailed failure
    class ReturnedToSender failure
    class Delivered terminal
```

